            <ArticleTitle>Giant intrapericardial aneurysm of the left atrial appendage.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>848-53</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A young patient is reported with an aneurysm of the left atrial appendage having supraventricular arrhythmias and a period of chest pain accompanied by a rise in cardiac enzymes. Compression of the left anterior descending coronary artery by the aneurysm was felt to be responsible for the myocardial injury.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
